  </reporting-org>
  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Madagascar Youth Skills for Economic Transformation and Jobs Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this project, skills development extends beyond TVET and professional training to encompass the professional higher education sector and on-the-job training. To build a high-value-added economy, a diverse range of skills is needed across the entire value chain. Consequently, this project will take an inter-ministerial approach, focusing on skills development at multiple levels, from lower-level skills to higher-level skills. The project will be national in scope with prioritized location to be determined by appraisal and subject to completion of a needs assessment and targeting analysis.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increase the number of graduates with skills needed to access jobs in priority sectors.</narrative>
  </description>
